    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>Compact Groundcar.</em> Upgrades: TUp (+1 SP) Armored Chassis, Autopilot Terminal, Bulletproof Glass [x2], Bulwark Armor [x2], Combat Plow, TUp (Self-Driving Vehicle) Communications Center, CrystalDome, TUp (+30 SDP) Heavy Chassis, Hover Upgrade, NOS [x4], Reinforced Tires, Sealed Environment, Smuggling Upgrade [x2]. Fills a 6×6m area and hovers 1m up, ignoring small obstacles and rough ground. Rear cargo hold for 2 tons. Autopilot at Skill Base 14. Everyone plugged in counts as both driver and passenger, so two crew give it two Actions and two Move Actions, mounts included.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 85,000eb<br><strong>Nomad:</strong> 9<br><strong>SDP:</strong> 100<br><strong>SP:</strong> 18<br><strong>Seats:</strong> 2<br><strong>MOVE:</strong> 15<br><strong>Speed:</strong> 75 mph</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Vehicles</small></p>",
